            "speaker_id": 100996,
            "reply_to": "M1",
            "text": "The sequence T1 through T6 looks standard. Before we start T2 prep, the survey in T1 needs to be very thorough. We should check for any dampness on the existing walls, otherwise the new plaster from T4 will fail later. It's a common issue.",
