        "thread_goal": "Run post-project review and lock improvement actions for next floors.",
        "messages": [
          {
            "msg_id": "M44",
            "speaker_id": 83191,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Great work finishing the pilot floor, team. Now for the final task, T12: the post-project review. Let's capture what we learned to improve the process for the next floors. Please share your thoughts on what worked well and what could be better. I've started a document for this, A8.",
