              262009,
              262702,
              334628
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T12",
              "A8"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "tada",
                "count": 3
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M45",
            "speaker_id": 262009,
            "reply_to": "M44",
            "text": "What worked: The A2 Standard Work Checklist was a huge help. It made handovers easy. What could be better: We almost ran out of drywall screws. The material list needs a small buffer for consumables.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A2"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M46",
            "speaker_id": 100996,
            "reply_to": "M44",
            "text": "I agree, A2 was good. But we should add mandatory drying times between plaster coats. We had to fix one section in a meeting room because the second coat was applied too soon. Also, the daily updates in A5 were very effective for spotting issues early, like the pantry floor.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A2",
              "A5"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "bulb",
